    affiliation: "Otsuma Women's University, Faculty of Social Information Studies"
abstract: >-
  The system (instructions, two skills and the operating procedure), the five research papers
  written by autonomous AI research agents in five consecutive pre-registered runs, the records
  needed to reproduce and check each run, the in-loop AI reviews, and the external AI evaluation.
  In each run an off-the-shelf coding agent formulated its own research question, carried out
  the study, wrote a paper, was reviewed by an AI reviewer from another model family and
  submitted a revised paper, without human research intervention.
keywords:
  - autonomous research agents
  - AI scientist
  - research question formulation
  - AI peer review
  - reproducibility
